; the game's effects today (game/sound/card_fx.tsp) for the same moments as fx_rich.scene,
; on the voices the game gives them (sound.tsp CUE_VOICE: 2 the hero's, 5 the enemies'), the
; ones a moment chains played at once and waiting in line as the game's do
length 50s
effects game/sound/card_fx.tsp
; the roll: a rattle a die, as the dice land
at 30 cue rattle 2
at +8 cue rattle 2
at +8 cue rattle 2
at +8 cue rattle 2
at +8 cue rattle 2
; a wand's zap: the die played, the bolt, the blow
at +88 cue tok 2
at +0 cue zap 2
at +0 cue thump 5
; a big hit: the same today
at +120 cue tok 2
at +0 cue zap 2
at +0 cue thump 5
; a shield up
at +180 cue tok 2
at +0 cue ping 5
; a shield taking a blow
at +120 cue ping 5
; mana
at +120 cue tok 2
at +0 cue sparkle 2
; a book: the die, its bolt
at +120 cue tok 2
at +0 cue zap 2
; fleas, the curse's hiss after
at +150 cue buzz 5
at +0 cue hiss 5
; wet
at +120 cue splash 5
at +0 cue hiss 5
; lightning
at +120 cue thunder 5
; a heal
at +180 cue chime 2
; an enemy's blow: its growl, her yelp
at +150 cue growl 5
at +0 cue yelp 2
; an enemy beaten: the blow, the squeak
at +120 cue thump 5
at +0 cue squeak 5
; three of a kind: no sound of its own (the third fluff's heal chimes)
at +150 cue chime 2
; victory and defeat: the run's won and lost songs (the only ones)
at +150 tune game/sound/songs.tsp:WON
at +150 tune game/sound/songs.tsp:LOST
; the Bulldog King: an enemy's growl
at +180 cue growl 5
